@startuml
title Level 3 - Component Diagram - Search Engine

rectangle "Search Engine" {

    component "Frontier\nQueue / Stack" as Frontier

    component "Explored / Visited Set" as Visited

    component "Goal Test" as Goal

    component "Path Reconstructor" as Path

    component "BFS / DFS Algorithm" as Algorithm
}

Frontier --> Algorithm : Get Next Node
Algorithm --> Visited : Check / Mark Visited
Visited --> Algorithm : Visited Information
Algorithm --> Goal : Check Current Node
Goal --> Algorithm : Goal Reached?
Algorithm --> Path : Parent Information
Path --> Algorithm : Final Path

@enduml